%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented). Script text requires clinical approval.
sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Caller
  participant API as Calls API
  participant S as Safety engine
  participant EM as Escalation manager
  participant DB as Postgres
  C->>API: Asks whether to raise their flow setting
  API->>S: Check input
  S->>S: Medical detector matches personalized flow advice
  S-->>API: HIGH, medical_question, policy version
  API->>DB: Safety event, redacted
  API->>EM: Create escalation, reason medical
  EM->>DB: Insert escalation, status open
  Note over API: No specialist agent or LLM reply is generated
  API-->>C: Approved boundary script, refer to clinician, offer callback
  alt Caller wants a callback
    C->>API: Accepts callback
    API->>DB: Update escalation with callback request
    API-->>C: Approved confirmation, no promised time unless configured
  else Caller continues with a product question
    C->>API: Asks about batteries
    API->>S: Check input
    S-->>API: LOW, normal flow resumes
  end
